ity Council I think  it's really important that you  acknowledge the bad incidents in your  history especially when you look at how  easy and how how adaptable the Klan was  to the existing issues that were  happening in town and used those to  become very strong you know in in our  city government so we don't want that to  happen again I mean the whole point of  history and examining history is to  learn from it  our cities tour staff recently traveled  to Anaheim California to learn about its  rich history learn more about Anaheim  and other stops on our tour at c-span  org slash cities tour

